      "description": "Actionable file surface with the real file-size limit.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-document\"><button><strong>Choisir un fichier JSON</strong><span>Depuis ton téléphone · 50 Mo max.</span><em>Importer un fichier</em></button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-document{border:1px solid var(--line,#cdd5c9);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--raised,#ecefe7)}.ds-document button{font-family:Roboto,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;border:0;color:var(--ink,#243b2e);background:transparent;width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:28px 12px 24px;gap:9px;min-height:225px}.ds-document strong{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600}.ds-document span{font-size:.79rem;color:var(--muted,#58675a)}.ds-document em{font-style:normal;color:var(--primary,#375746);font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px}.ds-document button:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-document button:active{background:var(--soft,#dce9d2)}.ds-document button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#427759);outline-offset:3px}.ds-document button:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:not-allowed}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress surface",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "progress",
      "description": "Illustrative preview values; real app values come from the PC job.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-progress\"><div><strong>12 <small>/ 24</small></strong><span>textes traduits</span></div><progress value=\"12\" max=\"24\" aria-label=\"Progression de la traduction\"></progress><p>Traduction en cours…</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-progress{font-family:Roboto,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;background:var(--raised,#ecefe7);color:var(--ink,#243b2e);border-radius:16px;padding:24px 20px}.ds-progress div{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:19px}.ds-progress strong{font-size:2rem;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-progress small{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--muted,#58675a)}.ds-progress span{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted,#58675a)}.ds-progress progress{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line,#cdd5c9);height:6px;width:100%;accent-color:var(--primary,#375746)}.ds-progress progress::-webkit-progress-bar{background:var(--line,#cdd5c9)}.ds-progress progress::-webkit-progress-value{background:var(--primary,#375746);border-radius:8px;transition:width .3s ease-out}.ds-progress p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#58675a);margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.55}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-progress progress::-webkit-progress-value{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "History row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "job-row",
      "description": "Illustrative filename and timestamp show the shipped metadata hierarchy.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-job\"><strong>dialogues.json</strong><span>Terminée · 5 oct., 14:32:08 · Anglais</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-job{font-family:Roboto,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:88px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:16px 0;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#cdd5c9);background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#243b2e)}.ds-job strong{font-size:.94rem;font-weight:550;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-job span{color:var(--muted,#58675a);font-size:.76rem;margin-top:6px}.ds-job:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-job:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#427759);outline-offset:3px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Facing-Page Desk",
    "overview": "Kotoba is a quiet reading desk for translation work: warm surfaces, deep green ink and leaf-toned actions keep the document and its state readable. The source and translated file remain distinct; typography and ruled rows provide structure without decorative imagery.\n\nThe interface uses Android system typography, generous touch targets and an OS-driven dark palette. Tonal containers group document, progress and connection information; history stays a simple list. This documents the implemented React/Tauri Android system, using the direction already delegated by the user.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm paper and green ink, paired with a complete dark palette.",
      "System typography and large touch controls.",
      "Flat tonal containers, ruled history and linear progress.",
      "Code-led visual assets with no illustrative raster imagery."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the OS theme palette consistently across content and Android system bars.",
      "Do preserve 48px minimum language selection and icon-button targets, and 54px primary actions.",
      "Do allow filenames, messages and technical paths to wrap.",
      "Do show history time and destination language alongside state.",
      "Do keep the import limit explicit: 50 Mo.",
      "Do pair progress and status colors with readable text."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add decorative raster illustrations to the file-processing flow.",
      "Don't replace linear progress with a decorative ring.",
      "Don't turn the ruled history into nested cards.",
      "Don't hide review warnings or treat cached history as proof of connectivity."
    ]
  }
}
